  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion (e.g., config_019) achieve high validation accuracy. This experiment tests whether replacing the RNA encoder from pca_n2000 (used in config_019) to scvi_n200 (a more complex encoder) maintains or improves performance, clarifying the impact of RNA encoder choice on the top-performing configuration. This balances exploitation of known effective components with exploration of critical design decisions."
